OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity staff to strike over
OL,4,Ajob cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at the University of Essex are
OL,7,Fset to strike next week over cuts to
OL,8,F400 full-time jobs.
OL,10,FThe union, Unison, said admissions
OL,11,Fadvisors, IT technicians, admin workers
OL,12,Fand other professional services staff
OL,13,Fwould walk out on Monday over the
OL,14,Fproposals.
OL,16,FIt said the #24m cuts had already
OL,17,Fforced the closure of the university's
OL,18,FSouthend campus, adding that job cuts
OL,19,Fwould "hit the quality of students'
OL,20,Feducation and the support available to
OL,21,Fthem".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
