OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity staff to strike over
OL,4,Ajob cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the university said:
OL,7,F"[We are] committed to making sure any
OL,8,Findustrial action affects our students
OL,9,Fas little as possible. We've engaged
OL,10,Ffully with union leaders... and their
OL,11,Ffeedback has helped shape our
OL,12,Fdecisions."
